 "description": "<p>A cat bell collar in leather with an attached chain, sold as a set in black or pink. The collar adjusts through 40-50 cm and the bell hangs where it should - audible but not loud.</p>\n<p>The chain extends the collar into leash territory without committing to it, which is the design decision this genre revolves around. Set packaging means collar and chain arrive matched.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: leather</li>\n<li>Item type: collar with chain</li>\n<li>Style: cat bell</li>\n<li>Color: set black or set pink</li>\n<li>Fit: 40-50 cm circumference</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Choose the set colorway at order. The bell-and-chain combination that defines the cat accessory look.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Leather cat bell collar with attached chain in black or pink set, adjustable 40-50 cm.</p>\n",
